  "body": "Uncover the immense opportunity behind this classic home, currently undergoing key improvements to bring out its best features. Situated on a single-lot site with independent services, this property combines native character with expansive functional areas.\r\n\r\nKey Features & Improvements\r\n\r\n• Massive Basement & Garage Space: Features a huge garage and basement area spanning the entire footprint of the existing house, offering exceptional storage, workshop space, or future potential.\r\n\r\n• Building Permit & Consenting Progress: Vendors are addressing the outstanding building permit for the basement works by applying for a Safe & Sanitary report.\r\n\r\n• Resolved Boundaries: The rear garage structure is scheduled for removal shortly, cleanly resolving existing boundary encroachment issues.\r\n\r\n• Deck & Outdoor Enhancements: Deck repairs are currently underway, complemented by a fully Butynol-sealed deck surface below to ensure durability and seamless weatherproofing.\r\n\r\n• Native Timber Floors: Carpets have been stripped back to expose original, gorgeous native timber floors ready to be polished.\r\n\r\n• Independent Utilities: Serviced by its own existing sewer system and dedicated tank water supply.\r\n\r\n• Seaview & Light Potential: Neighbors have recently agreed to allow tree trimming on their end (at the purchaser's arrangement and expense), offering an exciting opening to reveal potential seaviews and maximize natural sunlight.\r\n\r\nThe Opportunity\r\n\r\nIdeal for savvy buyers, investors, or renovators looking to leverage work already in motion. With boundary issues resolved, structural upgrades taken care of, and authentic character waiting to be unlocked, 107 Wainui Road offers a prime foundation for future capital growth.\r\n\r\nContact us today to inspect the site and explore the potential!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
